---
/**
 * The mark at the top of each window card.
 *
 * Arrived pasted into a `?inspect` capture on 2026-08-26, carrying three
 * `data-v-51d4e60c` attributes — Vue scoped-style hooks from whatever site it
 * was copied out of. They are stripped: they select nothing here and would sit
 * in the markup forever looking like they meant something.
 *
 * `preserveAspectRatio="none"` and `vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"` are
 * kept as pasted — together they let the mark stretch to any box while the
 * stroke stays 3px.
 */
---

<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="4 4 22 22" aria-hidden="true">
  <path
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-linecap="square"
    stroke-width="3"
    stroke-miterlimit="10"
    vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"
    d="M5 5v5l10-5v5l10-5v5m0 10v-5l-10 5v-5L5 20v-5h10v-5M5 20v5l10-5v5l10-5v5"
  />
</svg>
